{"unit":30,"section":2,"cefr":"A1","objective":"describe your family","skill":"Family","heading":"Describe your family","phrases":[{"he":"את יודעת, הבן שלי רופא.","en":"You know, my son is a doctor.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/4280a65f0309aa422386056d2c77899b","tokens":[{"w":"את","h":["you"]},{"w":"יודעת","h":["know","knows"]},{"w":"הבן","h":["the son","the boy","the child"]},{"w":"שלי","h":["my","mine"]},{"w":"רופא","h":["a doctor","doctor"]}]},{"he":"יש לי שני אחים גדולים ואח אחד קטן.","en":"I have two older brothers and a younger brother.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/6add6e7742c327c7e3e6fb76eb462f56","tokens":[{"w":"יש","h":["I have","have","there are","has"]},{"w":"לי","h":["I have","me","to me","for me"]},{"w":"שני","h":["two (masc.)","both of","both"]},{"w":"אחים","h":["brothers","siblings"]},{"w":"גדולים","h":["big","big (m,p)","large"]},{"w":"ואח","h":["and a brother"]},{"w":"אחד","h":["one (masc.)","just anyone"]},{"w":"קטן","h":["little (sg. masc.)","small (sg. masc.)"]}]},{"he":"הם בעל ואישה.","en":"They are husband and wife.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/bcfe0688341ed7c898617d94ddf7b852","tokens":[{"w":"הם","h":["they are","are","they"]},{"w":"בעל","h":["husband"]},{"w":"ואישה","h":["and a wife"]}]},{"he":"יש לי כבר נכד, עכשיו אני רוצֶה נכדה.","en":"I already have a grandson, now I want a granddaughter.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/48f96138432e2fe3617edbe0178ac227","tokens":[{"w":"יש","h":["I have","have","there are","has"]},{"w":"לי","h":["I have","me","to me","for me"]},{"w":"כבר","h":["already","yet","anymore"]},{"w":"נכד","h":["grandson"]},{"w":"עכשיו","h":["now"]},{"w":"אני","h":["I","I am","me"]},{"w":"רוצֶה","h":["want","wants","would like"]},{"w":"נכדה","h":["granddaughter"]}]},{"he":"אני ובן דודי אוכלים ארוחת בוקר.","en":"My cousin and I are eating breakfast.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/78adde1b453bd0f34bac84e385499261","tokens":[{"w":"אני","h":["I","I am","me"]},{"w":"ובן","h":["and my cousin"]},{"w":"דודי","h":["and my cousin"]},{"w":"אוכלים","h":["are eating","eating","eat"]},{"w":"ארוחת","h":["breakfast"]},{"w":"בוקר","h":["breakfast","morning"]}]},{"he":"בן זוגי מבשל לי אוכל טעים.","en":"My partner cooks me delicious food.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/c6f63432f73b7bebd76ca65a85a7d5a2","tokens":[{"w":"בן","h":["my partner","son","boy","years old (sg. masc.)"]},{"w":"זוגי","h":["my partner"]},{"w":"מבשל","h":["cooks","is cooking","cook"]},{"w":"לי","h":["me","to me","for me"]},{"w":"אוכל","h":["food","eats","is eating"]},{"w":"טעים","h":["tasty","delicious"]}]}],"words":[{"he":"כבר","en":"already","alt":["anymore","no longer","not anymore","yet"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"בוקר","en":"breakfast","alt":["breakfasts","for breakfast","morning","to breakfast"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"יודעת","en":"know","alt":["knows"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הבן","en":"the boy","alt":["the child","the son"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"רופא","en":"a doctor","alt":["doctor"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"אחים","en":"brothers","alt":["siblings"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"גדולים","en":"big","alt":["big (m,p)","large"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"ואח","en":"and a brother","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"אחד","en":"just anyone","alt":["one (masc.)"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"בעל","en":"husband","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"ואישה","en":"and a wife","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נכד","en":"grandson","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נכדה","en":"granddaughter","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"ובן","en":"and my cousin","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"דודי","en":"and my cousin","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"אוכלים","en":"are eating","alt":["eat","eating"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"בן","en":"my partner","alt":["boy","son","years old (sg. masc.)"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"זוגי","en":"my partner","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"סבתא","en":"grandma","alt":["grandmother"],"from":"skill"},{"he":"בת","en":"daughter","alt":["the cousin","the female cousin","years old (sg. fem.)"],"from":"skill"},{"he":"המשפחה","en":"the family","alt":[],"from":"skill"},{"he":"את","en":"you","alt":[],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"שלי","en":"my","alt":["mine"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"יש","en":"I have","alt":["have","there are","has"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"לי","en":"I have","alt":["me","to me","for me"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"שני","en":"both","alt":["two (masc.)","both of"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"קטן","en":"small (sg. masc.)","alt":["little (sg. masc.)"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"הם","en":"they are","alt":["are","they"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"עכשיו","en":"now","alt":[],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"אני","en":"I","alt":["I am","me"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"רוצֶה","en":"want","alt":["wants","would like"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"ארוחת","en":"breakfast","alt":[],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"מבשל","en":"cooks","alt":["is cooking","cook"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"אוכל","en":"food","alt":["eats","is eating"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"טעים","en":"delicious","alt":["tasty"],"from":"phrase"}],"lexemes":["הנכדה","לנכדה","נכדה","אחים","בן דוד","אחייניות","הדוֹד","נישואין","סבתא","בן זוג","לכל","בת זוג","בן זוגי","בת","בן זוגו","בת זוגי","משפחה","שם משפחה","החתן","הבת","וסבתות","שם המשפחה","וסבתא","ויפים","המשפחה","הבן","הסבתא","בת זוגו"],"tips":"**Cousins**\n\nIn Hebrew the word for a male cousin is literally “son of uncle” (בן דוד), and the word for a female cousin is “daughter of aunt” (בת דודה). Technically, “son of aunt” and “daughter of uncle” are possible, but in effect we like to group the genders together."}